  },
  "subQuests": [
    {
      "subId": "2202001",
      "subQuestName": "Talk to Ryuuji",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "220200101"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "220200101": {
            "id": "220200101",
            "speakerId": 3042,
            "speakerName": "Ryuuji",
            "text": "Huh. What are the odds, Traveler? Sango was right about us meeting again.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220200102"
            ]
          },
          "220200102": {
            "id": "220200102",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "What brings you here?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220200103"
            ]
          },
          "220200103": {
            "id": "220200103",
            "speakerId": 3042,
            "speakerName": "Ryuuji",
            "text": "Sango asked me to finish up the last job.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220200104"
            ]
          },
          "220200104": {
            "id": "220200104",
            "speakerId": 3042,
            "speakerName": "Ryuuji",
            "text": "Which just involves bringing some dessert to the Doushin to thank them for their assistance.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220200107"
            ]
          },
          "220200107": {
            "id": "220200107",
            "speakerId": 3042,
            "speakerName": "Ryuuji",
            "text": "That's true. Well, it's just an excuse to improve our relationship with them.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220200108"
            ]
          },
          "220200108": {
            "id": "220200108",
            "speakerId": 3042,
            "speakerName": "Ryuuji",
            "text": "After all, our detective agency may need their help someday."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "2202002",
      "subQuestName": "Talk to Amano and Andou",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "220200201"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "220200201": {
            "id": "220200201",
            "speakerId": 3046,
            "speakerName": "Amano",
            "text": "Oh, it's you, Traveler. What are you doing here?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220200202"
            ]
          },
          "220200202": {
            "id": "220200202",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "This is for you from Ryuuji.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220200203"
            ]
          },
          "220200203": {
            "id": "220200203",
            "speakerId": 3046,
            "speakerName": "Amano",
            "text": "Oh? Let's see... Wow, Sakura Mochi... Ah, that lad Ryuuji, he really didn't have to...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220200204"
            ]
          },
          "220200204": {
            "id": "220200204",
            "speakerId": 3046,
            "speakerName": "Amano",
            "text": "#Hey, Andou. Stop being so cautious. The Traveler may be an outlander, but {F#she}{M#he} just helped us, didn't {F#she}{M#he}?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220200205"
            ]
          },
          "220200205": {
            "id": "220200205",
            "speakerId": 3046,
            "speakerName": "Amano",
            "text": "I'm surprised Ryuuji still remembers what we like. Being colleagues with him sure has its perks...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220200206"
            ]
          },
          "220200206": {
            "id": "220200206",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "You guys worked together with Ryuuji?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220200207"
            ]
          },
          "220200207": {
            "id": "220200207",
            "speakerId": 3046,
            "speakerName": "Amano",
            "text": "Hmm? He didn't mention it to you? We worked with him for a short time.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220200208"
            ]
          },
          "220200208": {
            "id": "220200208",
            "speakerId": 3046,
            "speakerName": "Amano",
            "text": "But he suddenly got wrapped up in a certain incident.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220200209"
            ]
          },
          "220200209": {
            "id": "220200209",
            "speakerId": 3046,
            "speakerName": "Amano",
            "text": "Thanks to Sango, the real culprit was caught and Ryuuji was exonerated. Later, he left the police station and went to work for Sango.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220200210"
            ]
          },
          "220200210": {
            "id": "220200210",
            "speakerId": 3046,
            "speakerName": "Amano",
            "text": "That's all I know...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220200211"
            ]
          },
          "220200211": {
            "id": "220200211",
            "speakerId": 3047,
            "speakerName": "Andou",
            "text": "Okay. That's probably enough about that.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220200212"
            ]
          },
          "220200212": {
            "id": "220200212",
            "speakerId": 3046,
            "speakerName": "Amano",
            "text": "True. Anyway, he's been having it a lot easier with Sango than with us.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220200213"
            ]
          },
          "220200213": {
            "id": "220200213",
            "speakerId": 3046,
            "speakerName": "Amano",
            "text": "If I could, I'd also like to...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220200214"
            ]
          },
          "220200214": {
            "id": "220200214",
            "speakerId": 3047,
            "speakerName": "Andou",
            "text": "Hey, come on...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220200215"
            ]
          },
          "220200215": {
            "id": "220200215",
            "speakerId": 3046,
            "speakerName": "Amano",
            "text": "Ahem! By the way, thank you, Traveler. I'll take these desserts.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220200216"
            ]
          },
          "220200216": {
            "id": "220200216",
            "speakerId": 3046,
            "speakerName": "Amano",
            "text": "Say hello to Ryuuji and Sango for me."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "2202003",
      "subQuestName": "Talk to Owada",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "220200301"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "220200301": {
            "id": "220200301",
            "speakerId": 3019,
            "speakerName": "Owada",
            "text": "Hmm? You're... the Traveler, right? I heard Amano mention you.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220200302"
            ]
          },
          "220200302": {
            "id": "220200302",
            "speakerId": 3019,
            "speakerName": "Owada",
            "text": "Is there something you'd like to see me about?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220200303"
            ]
          },
          "220200303": {
            "id": "220200303",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "This is from Ryuuji.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220200304"
            ]
          },
          "220200304": {
            "id": "220200304",
            "speakerId": 3019,
            "speakerName": "Owada",
            "text": "Wow, it's Sakura Mochi... Well then, I can't simply eat it casually. I'll have to find a nice place to enjoy it.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220200305"
            ]
          },
          "220200305": {
            "id": "220200305",
            "speakerId": 3019,
            "speakerName": "Owada",
            "text": "Uesugi, please cover for me a bit. If someone comes to see me, tell them to wait a moment.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220200306"
            ]
          },
          "220200306": {
            "id": "220200306",
            "speakerId": 3020,
            "speakerName": "Uesugi",
            "text": "But it's work hours, Mr. Owada...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220200307"
            ]
          },
          "220200307": {
            "id": "220200307",
            "speakerId": 3019,
            "speakerName": "Owada",
            "text": "Hahaha, it's okay. I'm just going out for some air. I'll be back soon.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220200308"
            ]
          },
          "220200308": {
            "id": "220200308",
            "speakerId": 3020,
            "speakerName": "Uesugi",
            "text": "*sigh*... Okay, but please come back soon. If any of the higher-ups come by...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220200309"
            ]
          },
          "220200309": {
            "id": "220200309",
            "speakerId": 3019,
            "speakerName": "Owada",
            "text": "Don't worry, we just solved a case, so if someone comes, they'll be here to praise us.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220200310"
            ]
          },
          "220200310": {
            "id": "220200310",
            "speakerId": 3019,
            "speakerName": "Owada",
            "text": "I'll leave it to you then, Uesugi.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220200311"
            ]
          },
          "220200311": {
            "id": "220200311",
            "speakerId": 3019,
            "speakerName": "Owada",
            "text": "Traveler, walk with me for a while. I know a perfect place for enjoying these Sakura Mochi."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "2202004",
      "subQuestName": "Follow Owada",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [],
        "dialogs": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "2202005",
      "subQuestName": "Talk to Owada",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "220200404"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "220200404": {
            "id": "220200404",
            "speakerId": 3019,
            "speakerName": "Owada",
            "text": "Ah... this place is nice, isn't it? I often come here...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220200405"
            ]
          },
          "220200405": {
            "id": "220200405",
            "speakerId": 3019,
            "speakerName": "Owada",
            "text": "The view is nice and the air is fresh.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220200406"
            ]
          },
          "220200406": {
            "id": "220200406",
            "speakerId": 3019,
            "speakerName": "Owada",
            "text": "If you have anything to ask me, now's the time.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220200408",
              "220200410"
            ]
          },
          "220200408": {
            "id": "220200408",
            "speakerId": 3019,
            "speakerName": "Owada",
            "text": "Did Ryuuji tell you that? Yes, Ryuuji and I did work together once.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220200411"
            ]
          },
          "220200411": {
            "id": "220200411",
            "speakerId": 3019,
            "speakerName": "Owada",
            "text": "I don't know if Ryuuji has mentioned what happened back then.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220200412"
            ]
          },
          "220200412": {
            "id": "220200412",
            "speakerId": 3019,
            "speakerName": "Owada",
            "text": "Simply put, Ryuuji was too impulsive. He wound up walking into a trap and becoming a scapegoat.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220200413"
            ]
          },
          "220200413": {
            "id": "220200413",
            "speakerId": 3019,
            "speakerName": "Owada",
            "text": "I vouched for him, but the judge still insisted on convicting him.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220200414"
            ]
          },
          "220200414": {
            "id": "220200414",
            "speakerId": 3019,
            "speakerName": "Owada",
            "text": "I asked many people to help investigate, but they either came back empty-handed or told me not to continue the investigation.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220200415"
            ]
          },
          "220200415": {
            "id": "220200415",
            "speakerId": 3019,
            "speakerName": "Owada",
            "text": "Heh. At that time, I... How should I put it... I heeded the warning and didn't investigate further.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220200416"
            ]
          },
          "220200416": {
            "id": "220200416",
            "speakerId": 3019,
            "speakerName": "Owada",
            "text": "It is a \"secret\" that everyone knows, just like the fact that Ryuuji was wrongly accused, so I don't mind telling you.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220200417"
            ]
          },
          "220200417": {
            "id": "220200417",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "But since everyone knows...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220200418"
            ]
          },
          "220200418": {
            "id": "220200418",
            "speakerId": 3019,
            "speakerName": "Owada",
            "text": "Ah, it's precisely because everyone knows that no one dares to interfere.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220200419"
            ]
          },
          "220200419": {
            "id": "220200419",
            "speakerId": 3019,
            "speakerName": "Owada",
            "text": "Fortunately, a detective who was out of the loop happened to come to the police station for business and became interested in the case.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220200420"
            ]
          },
          "220200420": {
            "id": "220200420",
            "speakerId": 3019,
            "speakerName": "Owada",
            "text": "Thanks to that detective, the case was finally solved and Ryuuji's name was cleared.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220200421"
            ]
          },
          "220200421": {
            "id": "220200421",
            "speakerId": 3019,
            "speakerName": "Owada",
            "text": "Ryuuji left the police station and worked for that detective from then on. That's the whole story.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220200422"
            ]
          },
          "220200422": {
            "id": "220200422",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Why are you telling me this?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220200423"
            ]
          },
          "220200423": {
            "id": "220200423",
            "speakerId": 3019,
            "speakerName": "Owada",
            "text": "Who asked you to give me this gift?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220200424"
            ]
          },
          "220200424": {
            "id": "220200424",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Ryuuji.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220200425"
            ]
          },
          "220200425": {
            "id": "220200425",
            "speakerId": 3019,
            "speakerName": "Owada",
            "text": "I'm sure this gift was Sango's doing.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220200426"
            ]
          },
          "220200426": {
            "id": "220200426",
            "speakerId": 3019,
            "speakerName": "Owada",
            "text": "Given Ryuuji's character, if Sango had asked him to deliver the gift personally, he would have delivered it to me in mint condition even if I was trapped in a sea of fire.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220200427"
            ]
          },
          "220200427": {
            "id": "220200427",
            "speakerId": 3019,
            "speakerName": "Owada",
            "text": "But Ryuuji asked you to deliver the gift to me, which means that Sango asked him to have you do it.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220200428"
            ]
          },
          "220200428": {
            "id": "220200428",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "So Sango wanted me to know, then?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220200429"
            ]
          },
          "220200429": {
            "id": "220200429",
            "speakerId": 3019,
            "speakerName": "Owada",
            "text": "Hahaha, you're no slowcoach either. Your presence here means that Sango is telling me, \"I have a new helper.\"",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220200430"
            ]
          },
          "220200430": {
            "id": "220200430",
            "speakerId": 3019,
            "speakerName": "Owada",
            "text": "It seems that she isn't over what happened back then.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220200431"
            ]
          },
          "220200431": {
            "id": "220200431",
            "speakerId": 3019,
            "speakerName": "Owada",
            "text": "Actually, that's not surprising. After all... she hasn't found the real person who laid that trap yet...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220200432"
            ]
          },
          "220200432": {
            "id": "220200432",
            "speakerId": 3019,
            "speakerName": "Owada",
            "text": "Well, I've told you everything I can. You can decide for yourself whether you want to join Sango or not.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220200433"
            ]
          },
          "220200433": {
            "id": "220200433",
            "speakerId": 3019,
            "speakerName": "Owada",
            "text": "Oh, and thank Ryuuji for the Sakura Mochi for me. I've always enjoyed them."
          },
          "220200410": {
            "id": "220200410",
            "speakerId": 3019,
            "speakerName": "Owada",
            "text": "It was his own choice to leave."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "2202006",
      "subQuestName": "Talk to Ryuuji",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "220200501"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "220200501": {
            "id": "220200501",
            "speakerId": 3042,
            "speakerName": "Ryuuji",
            "text": "Sorry for troubling you, Traveler. Did you give the gifts to all of them?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220200504"
            ]
          },
          "220200504": {
            "id": "220200504",
            "speakerId": 3042,
            "speakerName": "Ryuuji",
            "text": "You found out? Sorry... It was Sango's idea to get you to deliver those.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220200505"
            ]
          },
          "220200505": {
            "id": "220200505",
            "speakerId": 3042,
            "speakerName": "Ryuuji",
            "text": "Sango said that you will be indispensable in helping solve that case and uncovering the real culprit."
          }
        }
      }
    }
  ]
}